"C:\\Users\\CP24\\AppData\\Local\\Microsoft\\WindowsApps\\pwsh.exe" -NoProfile -Command "python -c \"import pathlib,json; names=['skille/sprawy-prawne-w-firmie/references/moduly/spory-z-kontrahentem.md','skille/sprawy-prawne-w-firmie/references/moduly/umowy-wlasne-firmy.md','skille/sprawy-prawne-w-firmie/references/moduly/najem-lokalu-firmowego.md']; print(json.dumps({n:'\\n'.join(str(i+1)+': '+s for i,s in enumerate(pathlib.Path(n).read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig').splitlines())) for n in names},ensure_ascii=True))\"" in C:\Users\CP24\AiXperts - projekty\katalog-skilli
